<title>USA: Whittman-Hart votes two-for-one split.</title>
<headline>Whittman-Hart votes two-for-one split.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whittman-Hart Inc said Monday it voted a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The split followed a special shareholders meeting at which the company's authorized common stock was increased to 37 million shares from 15 million.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be payable December 10, record December 3.</p>
<p>Whittman-Hart provides strategic information technology consulting and system integration services.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
